<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" class="scrollbar-thin scrollbar-thumb-slate-400">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>
        <%= title %>
    </title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/base.css">
</head>

<body class="h-screen bg-slate-50">
    <div class="bg-white border-b border-slate-200 print:block">
        <img
            src="/uploads/kop-surat/contoh-kop-surat.png"
            alt="Kop Surat Rapat Finalisasi APBD Tahun 2026"
            class="w-full max-h-40 aspect-4/1 object-contain object-center">
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
            <div class="py-5 px-6 bg-blue-900">
                <p class="text-blue-200 text-xs uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Undangan Rapat</p>
                <h1 class="text-white text-xl font-bold">Rapat Finalisasi APBD Tahun 2026</h1>
            </div>
            <div class="px-6 py-5 space-y-3">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                    <p class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                            class="lucide lucide-notepad-text preview-icon size-4.5 text-slate-500">
                            <path d="M8 2v4" />
                            <path d="M12 2v4" />
                            <path d="M16 2v4" />
                            <rect width="16" height="18" x="4" y="4" rx="2" />
                            <path d="M8 10h6" />
                            <path d="M8 14h8" />
                            <path d="M8 18h5" />
                        </svg>
                        <span class="font-semibold text-sm text-slate-500">Agenda</span>
                    </p>
                    <div class="h-32 mb-2.5 p-3 bg-gray-50 text-sm font-medium text-slate-800 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg overflow-auto scrollbar-thin scrollbar-thumb-slate-400">
                        <p>Rapat finalisasi APBD berfokus pada pengambilan keputusan akhir melalui rangkaian penyampaian laporan hasil evaluasi dari masing-masing komisi DPRD, yang dilanjutkan dengan proses sinkronisasi untuk menyelaraskan asumsi pendapatan, belanja, dan pembiayaan daerah. Di saat yang sama, dilakukan harmonisasi untuk memastikan alokasi dana telah mengakomodasi program prioritas masyarakat, penyusunan catatan atau rekomendasi perbaikan dari Badan Anggaran, hingga akhirnya ditutup dengan penandatanganan persetujuan bersama antara Kepala Daerah dan pimpinan DPRD sebelum disahkan dalam Rapat Paripurna.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                    <p class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                            class="lucide lucide-map-pin preview-icon size-4.5 text-slate-500">
                            <path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0" />
                            <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" />
                        </svg>
                        <span class="font-semibold text-sm text-slate-500">Lokasi / Ruang</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-800">Ruang Command Control (CoC)</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                    <p class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                            class="lucide lucide-calendar-1 preview-icon size-4.5 text-slate-500">
                            <path d="M11 13h1v4" />
                            <path d="M16 2v3" />
                            <path d="M3 9h18" />
                            <path d="M8 2v3" />
                            <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" />
                        </svg>
                        <span class="font-semibold text-sm text-slate-500">Tanggal</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-800"><time datetime="2026-09-22">22 September 2026</time></p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-1.5">
                    <p class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                            stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
                            class="lucide lucide-clock-fading preview-icon size-4.5 text-slate-500">
                            <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 1 7.38 16.75" />
                            <path d="M12 6v6l4 2" />
                            <path d="M2.5 8.875a10 10 0 0 0-.5 3" />
                            <path d="M2.83 16a10 10 0 0 0 2.43 3.4" />
                            <path d="M4.636 5.235a10 10 0 0 1 .891-.857" />
                            <path d="M8.644 21.42a10 10 0 0 0 7.631-.38" />
                        </svg>
                        <span class="font-semibold text-sm text-slate-500">Waktu Presensi</span>
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-800">13:40 - 14:00</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 bg-amber-50 text-amber-700 border border-amber-200 rounded-full text-xs font-medium">
                        <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                        <span>Sesi Sedang Berlangsung — Pendaftaran Dibuka</span>
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-4 px-6 pb-6">
                <button type="button" class="w-full bg-blue-900 hover:bg-blue-hover text-white font-semibold py-2.5 rounded-xl transition-colors cursor-pointer">Daftarkan Kehadiran Saya</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>